  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Having the ability to set Avatar Parameters using Udon in VRCSDK3 worlds would be really useful. Maps like Murder could use this effect to have avatars look more scared the less people there are in a room, and gokarting maps could use this to have character expressions based on race positions, to name a few uses. \nThe setups may need to be avatar specific, and I do think that parameters would need to be set as Udon-triggerable, or use a full setting for this, as I could see some worlds potentially messing with your avatar settings. But I think this could be really neat, and potentially extremely useful for both avatar and world developers to create more immersive and interactive experiences.",
